-- Expected boss timelines for the Timeline page: when each boss ability is cast, counted from
-- the pull, so abilities can be placed and planned before a pull is recorded. [1] is Normal and
-- Heroic, [2] Mythic. Spell IDs and seconds are facts about the encounters, as listed by the
-- Timeline Reminders community timelines for patch 12.1; phase times assume an average kill
-- speed and shift with damage. A recorded pull always replaces this data. Abilities use the
-- spell IDs the boss mods and the built-in timers announce, so reminders bound here fire.
-- Each event is {spell, {times}, icon spell, name}: the spell is the ID boss mods announce,
-- the icon spell (when it differs) carries the ability's own journal icon.
local _, ns = ...
local T = {}
ns.BossTimelines = T
-- Icon and name of a boss ability by the ID reminders bind to.
ns.BossAbilityIcon, ns.BossAbilityName = {}, {}
